# w.lang.en/shards/words-k.kinds: the English words of k.kinds (its types, keys and values), owned by the language world
# (Q78, reviewer 16:10; KR3): they were the core.word facts of its schema; tools/build-catalog.mjs reads them as its own words.
# sources: hand-core 1 (written in this repository; the block at the end by tools/key-words.mjs)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written); the block of word wires for keys: tools/key-words.mjs

@w.lang.en.word.k.kinds.parent core.word text=parent text=parents text="up edge" text="kind of" means=k.kinds.parent core.source="hand-core 1"
@w.lang.en.word.k.kinds.kind core.word text=kind text="kind of" text=type text="type of" means=k.kinds.kind core.source="hand-core 1"

